{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32644","headline":"秋日过昭陵 · 刘沧","name":"秋日过昭陵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寝庙徒悲劒与冠，翠华龙驭杳漫漫。\n原分山势入空塞，地匝松阴出晚寒。\n上界鼎成云缥缈，西陵舞罢泪阑干。\n那堪独立斜阳里，碧落秋光烟树残。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32644.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32644","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}